Wiki-derived data
-----------------
Drop rates, node names and farming recommendations in scripts/data/ and
static/data/dataset.json are compiled from the Warframe Wiki
(https://wiki.warframe.com), which publishes under CC BY-SA 3.0, and from the
official drop tables (https://www.warframe.com/droptables). Each curated
recommendation carries a `source` URL and a `lastVerified` date.

Upstream packages
-----------------
Generated data is built from @wfcd/items and warframe-worldstate-data
(WFCD, MIT). Live world state is proxied from https://api.warframestat.us.
